// template: Low Ceiling
// order: 1
// Tech house: a rubbery bass whose filter snaps shut on every note (a per-note envelope
// over resonance), a recorded voice that talks through a square-wave vowel, low toms,
// djembe slaps and congas swung against the closed hats, a dub chord stab thrown into
// the long delay, a drum bridge for the DJ and an acid line that takes over the second
// drop. Style reference only; every melody is original.
title "Low Ceiling"
tempo 126
key g minor
kick:    kick       punch    x... x... x... x...                                   | decay 0.26 | pitch 50 | click 0.5 | click-tone 2600 | drive 0.25 | eq-mid -4 | eq-mid-freq 200 | gain 1.28
clap:    clap       snap     .... x... .... x...                                   | decay 0.16 | spread 0.6 | eq-mid 3 | eq-mid-freq 2000 | reverb small | gain 1.49
hat:     hat        closed   x x X x x x X x x x X x x x X x?0.6 / x x X x x x X x x x X x x X X x?0.6   | velocity 0.7 | swing 0.08 | pan -0.2 | gain 0.88
ohat:    hat        closed   ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x.                                   | open 0.4 | decay 0.18 | pan 0.2 | gain 0.74
shaker:  shaker     bright   x x?0.7 X x x x?0.7 X x x x?0.7 X x x x?0.7 X x?0.8   | decay 0.05 | color 0.8 | swing 0.08 | velocity 0.5 | pan 0.3 | gain 0.54
tom:     tom        floor    . . . . . . x . . . . x . . x . / . . . . . . x . . x . . . . x x?0.5   | tune 0.45 | decay 0.3 | swing 0.08 | pan -0.3 | reverb room | gain 0.61
slap:    djembe     slap     . x . . . . . . . x . . . . . . / . x . . . . . x . . . . . x . .   | tune 0.65 | swing 0.08 | pan 0.35 | reverb small | gain 0.68
conga:   conga      high     . . x . . x . . . . x . . x . x?0.5 / . . x . . x . . . x . . . x . .   | swing 0.08 | pan 0.4 | reverb small | gain 0.61
bass:    reese      growl    . . g1 ~ . g1 . g2 . . g1 ~ . bb1 . g1 / . . g1 ~ . g1 . g2 . . f1 ~ . f1 . g1 / . . g1 ~ . g1 . g2 . . g1 ~ . bb1 . d2 / . . eb1 ~ . eb1 . eb2 . . f1 ~ . f1 . f2   | cutoff env(0.14) 1800..300 | resonance 0.5 | detune 0.35 | release 0.08 | duck 0.75 | gain 0.81
vox:     vox        aah      . . g3 . . g3 . bb3 . . g3 . . . . . / . . g3 . . g3 . bb3 . . c4 . bb3 . g3 . / . . g3 . . g3 . bb3 . . d4 ~ c4 . bb3 . / . . eb4 ~ . d4 . c4 . . c4 ~ bb3 . a3 .   | vowel square(1/8) 0.1..0.9 | crush 0.2 | delay 3/16 | reverb plate | gain 0.88
stab:    supersaw   thin     . . . Gm9 . . . . . . Gm9 . . . . . / . . . Gm9 . . . . . . Gm9 . . . Gm9 . / . . . Gm9 . . . . . . Gm9 . . . . . / . . . Ebmaj9 . . . . . . F . . . . .   | voicing open | release 0.12 | cutoff sine(8) 1500..4000 | delay 3/16 | reverb dub | duck 0.6 | gain 0.74
acid:    acid       classic  g2 . g3 g2 . g2 bb2! g2 . f2 g2 . g3! . d3 g2 / g2 . g3 g2 . g2 c3! bb2 . g2 f2 . d3! . c3 bb2 / g2 . g3 g2 . g2 bb2! g2 . f2 g2 . g3! . d3 g2 / eb2 . eb3 eb2 . eb2 g2! eb2 . f2 f2 . f3! . c3 a2   | cutoff saw(16) 300..2600 | resonance 0.78 | decay 0.18 | delay 3/16 | duck 0.6 | gain 0.81
sweep:   sweep      notch    x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | length 15 | gain 0.54
down:    downlifter both     x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb plate | gain 0.68
section intro   kick hat shaker tom
section groove  kick clap hat ohat shaker tom slap conga bass | loop
section vocal   kick clap hat ohat shaker tom slap conga bass vox
section break   shaker stab vox down
section build   hat shaker tom slap conga vox sweep
section drop    kick clap hat ohat shaker tom slap conga bass vox stab
section bridge  kick hat ohat shaker tom slap conga bass
section build2  shaker tom acid sweep
section drop2   kick clap hat ohat shaker tom slap conga bass vox stab acid
section outro   kick hat shaker tom
song intro 16, groove 16, vocal 16, break 16, build 8, drop 32, bridge 16, build2 8, drop2 32, outro 16
